  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Korniszon227/videos?sub_confirmation=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392449/description_925ade96-1d9b-4f2d-bf86-6b9ffb05f92b.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"70\"></a></em><em><a href=\"https://discord.gg/UmbU38vg2r\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392449/description_8b603dbf-8b49-4e57-b9dd-5cd817c64a43.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"70\"></a></em><em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fAnnoy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392449/description_36521f72-2fb0-4688-9b79-d8224d709b31.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"70\"></a></em><em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252fannoy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392449/description_9a2b8df6-5481-4291-a5e5-3b079c703c3b.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"70\"></a></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">很棒</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>此音效包將 Minecraft 的雷聲與打擊音效改為更具沉浸感的版本<br><br></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ambientsounds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ambient Sounds</a> 模組相容</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>移除惱人的天氣音效並加以替換</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/feE7e4U7Xh0\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
